{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19625","headline":"蜀绵州越王楼诗 · 樊宗师","name":"蜀绵州越王楼诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"危楼倚天门，如𨶻星辰宫\n榱薄龙虎怪，洄洄绕雷风。\n徂秋试登临，大霭屯乔空。\n不见西北路，考怀益雕穷。\n石濑薄溅溅，上山杳穹穹。\n昔人创爲逝，所适酡颜红。\n今我兹之来，犹校成岁功。\n辍田植科亩，游圃歌芳丛。\n地财无丛厚，人室安取丰。\n既乏富庶能，千万慙文翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊宗师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}